    "turn_text": "then he said, he wanted an impeachment inquiry, which is the way you started anyway. Yeah. Right? So, and then on Sunday, on the Sunday talk show, he did not say that he would support an impeachment process again. And we have some members, quite frankly, in our conference that don't want to do it because they're concerned that it would look like it would be political attack. And then others have said, well, we should be impeaching Joe Biden because he's the guy. But the way a cabinet works, and particularly, I believe this cabinet works, is these are individual fiefdoms. Joe Biden is, I mean, you saw the Potemkin Village in El Paso when he was down for four hours there. He has no idea, I believe, of everything that's going on and everything is bad. Mayorkas is running that show. And so we have, I introduced impeachment articles in August of 21 because he was violating everything from the parole statute to title eight and all of these things. And we started the first month of the Biden administration with a record. And every month since then has been a record, including last month, 250,000 encounters plus about 125,000 estimated Godaways into our country. We have no idea where they're from, what they're doing, what's going to happen. So my renewed articles and impeachment will be coming out in a couple of weeks. It will originate in the Judiciary Committee. I'm not sure every Republican is on board there yet, because the other thing is there is a minority view of what high crime is, and that's an actual criminal felony. That's not the majority view of scholars. nor my view, if you look back when we talk about high crimes, what it constitutes is basically abusing the American public. And there's a few other things that they kind of define around that. And a misdemeanor is not considered necessarily an actual criminal misdemeanor. This is a series of events that also abuse the American public. And what you're seeing in the border is it's unconscionable, absolutely unconscionable. And it's deliberate. Nobody is that incompetent. I just got to say, nobody is that incompetent. This",
